<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Your Playbook is Ready! — The VA Diaries</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #1A1A2E;
    color: #fff;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .card {
    background: #fff;
    color: #1A1A2E;
    border-radius: 20px;
    max-width: 560px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 48px 40px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }

  .emoji { font-size: 56px; margin-bottom: 16px; }

  .brand {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #E91E8C;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1A1A2E;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .download-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #E91E8C;
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 18px 40px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .download-btn:hover {
    background: #C2185B;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .view-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: transparent;
    color: #7B2D8B;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 12px 32px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    border: 2px solid #7B2D8B;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .view-btn:hover {
    background: #7B2D8B;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
    margin: 24px 0;
  }

  .email-section {
    background: #FCE4F3;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .email-section h3 {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #E91E8C;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .email-section p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .steps {
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .steps h3 {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1A1A2E;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .step {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .step-num {
    background: #E91E8C;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .step-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #444;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .footer-note {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #999;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .footer-note a {
    color: #E91E8C;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
  <div class="emoji">🎉</div>
  <div class="brand">The VA Diaries</div>
  <h1>Your Playbook is Here!</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Payment confirmed. Thank you so much! Your copy of <strong>From Scrolling to Earning: The 14-Day Social Media VA Playbook</strong> is ready to download.</p>

  <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pXOW3fmPiB3_DBRH1Vz3JaJJ7JoAPys8R99ROo-zLj8/export?format=pdf" class="download-btn" download>
    ⬇ Download Your Playbook (PDF)
  </a>

  <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pXOW3fmPiB3_DBRH1Vz3JaJJ7JoAPys8R99ROo-zLj8/edit?usp=sharing" class="view-btn" target="_blank">
    👁 View in Google Docs
  </a>

  <div class="email-section">
    <h3>📧 Want it sent to your email too?</h3>
    <p>Fill out the short form below with your name and email and I'll send your download link directly to your inbox within 24 hours on weekdays.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Replace this with your actual Google Form embed link -->
  <a href="YOUR_GOOGLE_FORM_LINK_HERE" class="view-btn" target="_blank" style="border-color:#E91E8C; color:#E91E8C;">
    ✉ Send to My Email
  </a>

  <hr class="divider"/>

  <div class="steps">
    <h3>What to do next</h3>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">1</div>
      <div class="step-text"><strong>Download or save your Playbook</strong> to your phone or laptop right now so you always have access.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">2</div>
      <div class="step-text"><strong>Start with Day 1 today.</strong> Don't wait. Even 20 minutes is enough to get going.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">3</div>
      <div class="step-text"><strong>Follow along on Instagram</strong> for daily tips, encouragement, and behind-the-scenes content.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="footer-note">
    Questions? Message me on Instagram <a href="https://instagram.com/thevadiaries" target="_blank">@thevadiaries</a>
  </p>
</div>

</body>
</html>
